OL,3,GNEWSAStories of fallen soldiers brought
OL,4,Ato life in display
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe personal stories of Wolverhampton
OL,7,Fservicemen killed in two world wars are
OL,8,Fbeing brought to life through a new
OL,9,Fremembrance exhibition designed to help
OL,10,Fyounger generations connect with their
OL,11,Fexperiences.
OL,13,FThe display, Echoes in the Silence,
OL,14,Ffeatures artefacts, letters,
OL,15,Fphotographs and hundreds of knitted
OL,16,Fpoppies collected by Ian Hughes over
OL,17,Fthe course of a year.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
