OL,3,GNEWSAStories of fallen soldiers brought
OL,4,Ato life in display
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said he believed many people under
OL,7,Fthe age of 40 had never met anyone who
OL,8,Ffought in the wars, making it
OL,9,Fincreasingly important that their
OL,10,Fexperiences were remembered.
OL,12,F"I want the young people to look and
OL,13,Fsay we can't let this happen again,"
OL,14,FHughes said.
